** {{audio|en|en-us-ongoing.ogg|a=US|IPA=/ɑnˈɡoʊ.ɪŋ/}}
* {{IPA|en|/ɔnˈɡoʊ.ɪŋ/|a=Southern US,Midland US,non-cot-caught}}
* {{IPA|en|/ɔnˈɡəʉ.ɪŋ/|a=AU}}
* {{IPA|en|/ɒnˈɡɐʉ.əŋ/|[ɔ̟nˈɡɐʉ̯.əŋ]|a=NZ}}
